  "note": "The full visible Uzunköprü crossing with 164 stone arch bays, larger river openings, pointed cutwaters, low parapets and fitted northwest and southeastern landings. The 11 m reference datum lies within the standard floodplain elevation range. Foundations embed into the unmodified Terrarium grid, the deck rises at the river bend and both approaches meet the native grade. Preview places the authored base at the recorded absolute sea-level elevation; local tide and terrain resolution remain host-dependent."
